% Post-auxiliary (VP) ellipsis is marked by 'ellipsis_ref' (referential
% subject, with an ARG1 to it) or 'ellipsis_expl' (expletive subject), cueing
% the search for an antecedent.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Ellipsis/):
%   ellipsis_ref[ARG1 x0]
%   ellipsis_expl[ARG1 u0]

pattern { E [pred=re"ellipsis_ref\|ellipsis_expl"] }
